WEBVTT

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:41.250
I'd like you to take another look...

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:44.260
Do you understand?

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:51.130
This mysterious person has
sent chills down the spines

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:54.930
Special Report on Ghosts

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:53.940
of these people.

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:00.590
Sis, let's change the channel.

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:02.650
I won't be able to go
to the bathroom!

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:05.340
You've gotta watch stories of
ghost reports in the summer.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.100
It lets you feel like you
saw something scary.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.680
What are ghosts?

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:12.910
Ghosts are spirits of dead people
who couldn't let go of life

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:14.910
and wander around.

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:16.390
Usually you can't see them.

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:18.560
I don't understand why
you should be scared

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:19.690
of something you can't squidly see.

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:22.540
They're scary <i>because</i> you can't see
them even though they're there!

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:23.840
That's so unscientific.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:24.910
Who are you to talk!?

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.540
Then what about that picture?

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:30.330
It appears as if he is simply
passing through,

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:31.100
They simply overlaid his
image onto the picture.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:31.900
however...

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.450
I guess they do stuff like that, but...

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:37.270
It's all in your head!
I won't squidly believe it until I see it!

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:43.930
Hm, I'm having a strong impulse to show
Squid Girl a ghost and freak her out.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:48.920
<b>Aren't you a fraidy-squid?</b>

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:54.120
So, we're going to have
a test of courage!

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.050
Why the squid do I
have to be here?

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:01.870
Consider it learning one
"Fun Japanese Custom".

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:02.930
Why do I have to be here?

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.040
You're the bodyguard.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:06.500
Man, I thought Chizuru was
going to be here, too.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:10.740
Apparently something
urgent came up...

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:11.730
or something...

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:15.250
I'll protect you if something
happens, Squiddie!

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:18.590
I'm scared!

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.640
Don't worry, Squiddie!

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.140
No reaction?!

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.800
This place is really bad,
let's go home.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.390
Don't be scared!

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:33.480
You're supposed to
be our bodyguard!

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:35.980
No one said anything about
non-human foes!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.120
And Chizuru isn't here...

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:37.940
Oh, sis...

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:39.890
Bring it on, ghosts!

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.870
Oh, I guess it was a fallen
samurai's ghost.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:46.680
Cut it out!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:51.790
When is the fun part
going to start?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:56.240
Um, it's not really "fun"...
Aren't you scared?

00:03:56.240 --> 00:03:57.530
Of what?

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:01.100
It's simply dark. What's
so scary about that?

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:04.910
This is a cemetery.
This is where dead people rest.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:08.120
Sharks and orcas are scarier
than dead people.

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:09.920
You guys are squidding weird.

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:12.240
This might not work.

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:13.770
Yeah, let's go home!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:14.690
No, we're staying!

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:19.060
I won't go home until
that happens.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:20.110
Yeah, yeah.

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.700
I anticipated that this
wouldn't scare her.

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:28.050
Which means that I have
to take action.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.200
Your scream scared me!

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:37.990
You threw a stone, didn't you?!
Cut it out!

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:40.190
You cut it out!
You ruined my plan!

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.590
You chicken life saver!

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:42.750
What did you say?

00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:43.870
I called you a chicken!

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:47.890
This is ugly. Hey, wait.

00:04:48.310 --> 00:04:49.440
Where is Squid Girl?

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:50.440
Oh, yeah...

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:52.140
I guess she went ahead.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.990
Where did everybody go?

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:59.190
I don't know how to get home.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:03.130
I guess I'll have to use
my squid glow.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:13.580
Squid Girl has the abilities
of a firefly squid.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.960
All right, they should be able to
spot me from tentacles away.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:20.370
Squid Girlie!

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:22.780
I don't see her anywhere.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:24.170
What is she doing?

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:27.310
I'm sure she went home.
We should go, too.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:29.510
Hey, isn't that...

00:05:31.110 --> 00:05:32.970
Oh, there you are.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:34.250
What?

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.090
No!

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:36.120
It's coming this way!

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.270
It's a floating soul!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.760
It's real!

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.680
What They See

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:42.560
<b>Reality</b>

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:43.840
Help!

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:44.850
Stay away!

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:47.530
Hey, why are you running away?

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:52.780
NOOO! It's a fallen samurai!
It's Genji's fallen samurai!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.390
Nooo!

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:56.160
Wait up.

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:59.330
Maybe they haven't seen me yet.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:00.460
Then...

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:01.880
It's flashing now!

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:02.570
It's so bright!

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.960
They'll see me if I flash.

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:09.590
It's a curse beam!
It's a Genji firefly! We'll be cursed!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:19.170
Humans are all so heartless.

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:29.190
I can't get back to the
ocean by myself.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:37.490
What the squid do you want?
I don't have time for this.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:41.920
Huh?

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:46.380
I can't understand what the squid
you're saying! Stop mumbling!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.470
Hey, stop it!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:51.040
Where are you taking me?

00:06:51.650 --> 00:06:52.870
Hey!

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:55.640
Untentacle me already!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.840
I know this path.

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:12.420
Did you actually show me the way?

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:24.030
I guess there are actually
squidly nice humans.

00:07:31.570 --> 00:07:34.500
Lemon House at the Sea

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:35.940
I can't believe you squidding
abandoned me.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:39.020
Sorry, we had no choice.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:43.420
I kind of took a picture,
but what should I do?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.580
This is definitely a ghost.

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:47.540
Shouldn't we hold a service for it?

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.440
Yeah...

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:50.590
This is pretty serious...

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:53.440
There's no way that ghosts
squidly exist.

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:59.860
It's been a while since
I came to the surface.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.080
I should have

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:05.220
conquered about half the planet
by now, but instead...

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.560
Is my beer coming?

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:08.430
Right away.

00:08:08.430 --> 00:08:11.370
What the squid am I doing here?

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:13.830
It's your fault for breaking
the wall of our store.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.740
It's already fixed!

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:17.970
You have to work off
the repair bill.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.430
How many tides will that take?

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:20.730
About 5 or 6 years?

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:22.890
Just how low is my wage anyway?!

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:25.920
Eiko, can I borrow Squid Girlie?

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:26.640
Borrow?

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:27.180
Don't break her.

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:28.610
What am I, an action figure?!

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:33.620
<b>You're the squid's
sworn enemy, aren't you?</b>

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:37.530
Watch out so Takeru
doesn't drown.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:39.490
You've gotta play in the
ocean once in a while.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:41.460
The repair bill...

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:46.720
Takeru, let's glide out further.

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:48.380
Ah, sure.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:53.340
Squid girlie, it's dangerous
to go out too far.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:57.530
It's pretty deep here, huh?

00:08:57.530 --> 00:09:00.640
Where? This is still really
shallow for me.

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:02.600
Your feet can reach the ground?

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:04.730
My tentacles can.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:08.890
You have it good.
You can live on land and in the sea.

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.190
Living in the ocean
sounds fun, too.

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.550
It's not all fun.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:16.930
Even I had my share of troubles
when I lived in the ocean.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:24.530
Phytoplankton | Zooplankton
Shrimp | Squid | Shark/Orca

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:17.920
Yum.

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.840
It's paradise while you're eating...

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.650
but there's the fear of being eaten

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:24.860
if you make a single mistake.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:27.940
Wouldn't controlling your
own ocean come before

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.010
taking over mankind?

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:32.400
Well, those guys wouldn't be
here, where it's shallow.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:37.210
O-o-o-o-o-o-o-o-orca?!

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:38.190
What's the matter?

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:40.510
Why is the squid's natural enemy
in such shallow water?!

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:43.770
And how can a mere
child ride it so well?

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:54.420
It's not getting angry even though
they're that squidding rough...

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.210
It must be trained quite well.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:58.350
Trained?

00:09:58.350 --> 00:10:00.480
The humans can't be underestimated.

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:10.640
Wha...? What is this?!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:16.500
They're all over the place!

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.230
<b>What Squid Girl Sees</b>

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:18.230
<b>Reality</b>

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:20.340
A-At this rate!

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:22.900
Holy Tentacles!

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.520
We have to go back
before they attack!

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.230
They?

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:30.480
Let's squidaddle!

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:39.780
I'm coming!

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:45.120
Are you okay?

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:46.050
Yeah.

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:48.620
It looks like he didn't even
swallow any water.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.200
How could you let him drown?

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.850
Can't you even babysit one kid?

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.960
Well, he's fine.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.550
Goro, thank you for saving him.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:03.330
It was nothing! That's my
duty as a lifeguard!

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:05.970
Hey, teach me how to swim.

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.530
I'll get made fun of if I don't
know how to swim,

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:09.800
even though I live by the water.

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:13.890
Yeah, huh. Can you teach him?

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:15.730
I'm busy right now, but next time.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.940
That would be wonderful.

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:19.610
It'll be my pleasure!

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:22.130
All right, let's start practicing!

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:23.100
Yay!

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:24.200
Let's go, Takeru.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.450
He's so simple.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:30.210
Wait just a squid!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.470
Squid Girlie?

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:34.730
I know how to get
away from them.

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:35.210
Huh?

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:37.590
Leave it to me!

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:44.510
That was pretty long. Very good.

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:47.030
That wasn't even a minute.

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:49.620
You won't be able to get away
from them like that.

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:51.310
It's fine, he's just starting.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:54.150
I'll show you how a
real squid does it.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:00.990
I'll get you!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.070
Wait!

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.070
Wait, you.

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:08.570
That's it. Relax a bit more.

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:11.200
You must be quite gutsy
to ignore me!

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.670
Oh, you wanted a
reaction from us?

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:17.000
All right, next, try breathing
with a 1-2-3 beat.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.770
Hey, stop getting in the way!

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:20.500
Don't bother with this
roundabout way.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:24.010
I'll teach you a much
easier way to swim.

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.070
Really?

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:26.140
What's that?

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:28.210
You start like this...

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.430
She didn't use her arms
or legs once!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:37.350
See, it's easy. You keep squidding like
that and get away from them.

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:38.320
Are you stupid?

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.750
I can't learn from you if you don't
use your arms and legs.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:42.730
Arms and legs are unnecessary.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:44.160
She's impossible.

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:46.870
Humans swim with nothing but those
unnecessary arms and legs.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:53.610
Being able to swim with ten
ultra-powerful tentacles is no feat.

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:55.330
If you want something
to brag about,

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:57.540
try swimming with nothing
but your arms and legs!

00:12:58.230 --> 00:13:00.260
A fine challenge!

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:05.460
I'll show you what the
Messenger from the Sea can do!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:13.840
Lame.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:17.250
Humans being able to swim
without tentacles is weird!

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:22.420
The mere fact that humans are swimming in the
water is an affront on all things squidly!

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.990
What's she talking about?

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:28.850
I'll show you!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.550
They're here again!

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:35.250
This time there's even a shark.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:38.790
A crocodile? Why the squid is
there a crocodile in the ocean?!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:42.130
What is that huge yellow fish?
I've never squidly seen it before!

00:13:43.410 --> 00:13:46.980
Th-This is hell...

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:48.120
<b>What Squid Girl Sees</b>

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.980
What... is she doing?

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:55.100
Hm. Oh, maybe she...

00:13:57.660 --> 00:14:01.290
If I swim underwater, I can get
home without being seen.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:03.380
Quite clever, if I must
say so myself.

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.990
I'll be safe up here with the landlubbers.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.660
Squid Girlie, I rented one.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:16.710
<b>What Squid Girl Sees</b>

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:16.790
It's not fair! They're coming from the mainland.

00:14:18.550 --> 00:14:21.240
Huh? Didn't you want to ride it?

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:24.430
Floatation device rental
Banana | Shark | Orca
It's fun!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:24.420
These are all floats?

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.390
Why the squid didn't you tell me?!

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:28.190
I'm sorry.

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:30.300
Dude, open your eyes!

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:38.730
I love the ocean.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:40.690
I love the waves.

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:43.440
I love surfing.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.850
My name is Saito Nagisa.

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:56.340
<b>Squidzooks!
Aren't you a new recruit?</b>

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:01.170
Good morning. I'll be working
here starting today.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:02.920
I'm Aizawa Chizuru.

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.810
Aizawa Eiko. Welcome!

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:05.520
Thanks.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:10.470
I'm surprised you came, considering the
pay is crap and there's no AC.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.290
I came because I can surf, too.

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:17.400
Oh you can surf? That's so cool.

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.410
Oh, it's nothing.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.380
By the way, where is Squid Girl?

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:22.750
Oh yeah.

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:26.270
Hey Squid Girl, come say, "Hello!"

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:27.680
Squid Girl?

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:31.320
I'm Squid Girl,
a messenger from the sea!

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:36.690
Wh-What is this creature?!
It's not human!

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:37.430
Oh my.

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:38.600
She's fresh...

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:40.640
Anyway, the police or the
health care service?

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:41.730
Whoa, wait wait.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:44.620
You don't have to worry.
Despite her appearance, she's harmless!

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:51.880
She looks really dangerous.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.390
Well, the dangers are
basically limited

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:56.220
to punching through walls
and tying people up.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.250
That's way worse than I thought!

00:15:58.250 --> 00:15:59.910
I can also spit squid ink.

00:15:59.910 --> 00:16:00.560
Eww!

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.380
Th-This is it!

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:05.100
This is the true squid feeling I've
been craving all this time!

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:11.240
Cowering in fear is how people
should react to an invader!

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:18.830
Knock it off!

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:21.040
Um...

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:26.180
Aren't you two scared at all?

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:27.290
Scared?

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:30.340
I was pretty shocked
when she punched

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.980
through the wall with
her tentacles.

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:32.860
But other than that...

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.590
I was angry that she broke it,

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:36.500
so this is how it's been since.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.520
Squid Girl's Ink

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:38.770
Squid ink is delicious and harmless.

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:40.290
You're collecting it in a bottle?

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:44.050
You two should be more
aware of the dangers.

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:47.080
It must be an emergency when
such a fearsome creature

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.690
appears on land!

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.610
If you underestimate it,
you'll be sure to regret it!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:54.200
It looks like that fearsome creature
has taken a liking to you.

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:59.360
To me, it seems like you're
being too afraid, Nagisa.

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:00.410
That's not...

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.830
Well, you'll figure it out while you work.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:12.730
Draft beer.

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:13.300
Me too.

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:15.160
Three beers then.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:16.910
Three draft beers, on the squiddle.

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:17.710
Got it.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.210
Squiddie!

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:21.670
Let go!

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:24.070
Here's your shrimp fried rice.

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:24.930
Thanks.

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:27.210
Enjoy.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.770
Wait. Why is this fried
rice toppingless?

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.010
What are you talking about?

00:17:31.010 --> 00:17:32.680
You rat, you ate them.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:34.350
That's slander!

00:17:34.350 --> 00:17:36.110
Then what's that on your face!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:36.930
It's snaky.

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.050
Pull it!

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.000
Let's tie it!

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.190
Those are not toys!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:43.480
The world is messed up.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:46.450
This makes it seem like I am the
only one who's weird and afraid.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:47.460
Oh, I see.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.750
Everybody here is messed up,

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.000
so they can't understand
what's going on.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:58.630
If things are left like this,
this creature will pass for normal.

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:02.570
But I wish I didn't have to hang out
with these people any more...

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:03.460
Nagisa?

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:05.050
Yes?

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:06.740
What do you want to
do about the job?

00:18:06.740 --> 00:18:09.560
You can still change your mind.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:10.730
Huh?

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:14.820
That's right. I can't waver now!

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.830
I'll keep it!

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:17.650
Great!

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.360
For mankind!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.460
Mankind?

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:22.820
I have to be an example of normalcy!

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:23.770
She's weird.

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:25.190
She's funny.

00:18:25.190 --> 00:18:26.510
I like her.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.160
This Nagisa...

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:34.090
She's like a shooting star of hope
in the darkness of space!

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:41.140
Yes, if more people become like her,
the world will be squidly ideal!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.330
I'm still uncomfortable around her.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.180
You'll get used to her quickly.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:51.950
That's true, it's very possible that she
will get used to my squidness.

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:54.400
I have to keep just enough
pressure on so she won't quit.

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:57.770
Oh, Nagisa...

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:02.660
It looks like you are only scared
of my physical appearance,

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:06.080
but that's no good for me.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:11.470
You see, I came to the surface world
in order to subjugate mankind.

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:15.010
Oh no... that's terrible!

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:19.550
Yay, that's the reaction
I was expecting!

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:22.160
What you're seeing is only a frac-

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:24.600
Stop showing off!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:25.340
Squid abuse!

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:26.970
Nagisa, listen to this.

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.690
Recently she saw an orca
float and got scared.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:34.200
Sh-Shut the squid up!

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:37.120
And on top of that,
she passed out and then...

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:40.570
Hey! Hey!
Enough, get back to work!

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:45.050
She looks like she's wavering a bit.

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:48.980
At this rate, she won't believe
that I'm an invader.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:51.620
I'll have to show her something convincing!

00:19:52.270 --> 00:19:53.510
Where are you going?

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:55.260
To think about something.

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:57.710
No... to do some prep work
for my squid-vasion!

00:19:57.950 --> 00:19:58.680
Oh, okay.

00:19:58.680 --> 00:20:01.240
Bye, be careful!

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:06.720
It looks like Squid Girl desperately
wants to scare Nagisa.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:09.660
I suppose she's the first to
be afraid of her.

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:13.090
Well, it's not like I don't
understand her.

00:20:13.090 --> 00:20:17.320
We can't ask Nagisa to
leave because of that.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.190
What can we do to allay her fear?

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:20.650
I know.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.320
Nagisa.

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.020
Yes?

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.770
Have you ever fished for squid?

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:29.140
Uh, no I haven't.

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:30.580
Hold this.

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:34.450
Is this a fishing rod?

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:37.210
Are we blowing off work to
go down to the water?

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:41.170
No, right here's fine.
You'll see something funny.

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:44.610
Squid fishing in here?

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.200
Wait, is this for that squid person?

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:52.140
No way, she came here to subjugate
mankind, she won't fall for...

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:59.550
S-S-Son of a squid.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.120
You see now, right?

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:05.590
She's got a big mouth, but she
really is nothing but a squid.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:13.160
What are you talking about?

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:17.800
It's true that her behavior makes
her look a little stupid.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:23.120
However, that doesn't change the fact
that she has a dangerous agenda

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:27.180
of "subjugating mankind" and that she has
these dangerous tentacle weapons!

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:30.130
She is a fearsome creature!

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:34.510
Even after seeing me
disgrace myself,

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:38.100
she still regards me
as being fearsome.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:43.280
Nagisa might be the only person in the
world who squidly understands me!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:45.990
Nagisa!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.660
Thank you so squidding much!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.120
Please stop!

00:21:58.120 --> 00:21:59.430
Are you okay?

00:21:59.430 --> 00:22:01.880
Why are you laughing
when she hates you?

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:05.510
It's fine. It's fine like this.

00:23:41.710 --> 00:23:43.850
Hi everybody, Aizawa Takeru here.

00:23:44.170 --> 00:23:45.940
Uh, so next time...

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:47.170
How much is that squiddy
in the window?

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:48.630
Ride 'em, Squiddy!

00:23:48.630 --> 00:23:50.020
You're phonier than an
11-tentacled squid!

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:51.380
All three!

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:54.390
But do your homework before watching!
